vkQuake is GPLv2. It is cloned at build time from
https://github.com/Novum/vkQuake and is not part of this source tree.
Small engine patches live in patches/vkquake/ and remain GPLv2.

A binary package that includes vkquake is therefore GPL-2.0-or-later overall.

